        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I could usome clarification on station cards:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1. During the requisition phase, are you buying from the stations entire complement of up to 15 cards, or just the top 3.&nbsp;</p><p>2. When flipping one of these cards during the aftermath phase, which of the three stacks are we supposed to draw from?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>Fernando</p>",
